		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "Hexerei is the quieter craft: herbs, candles, cauldrons and brooms.$(br2)Grow and dry herbs like $(l:magic/hexerei#sage_seed)Sage$(/l) and keep them in $(l:magic/hexerei#herb_jar)Herb Jars$(/l). Most of the work happens in the $(l:magic/hexerei#mixing_cauldron)Mixing Cauldron$(/l). The $(l:magic/hexerei#book_of_shadows)Book of Shadows$(/l) holds the rest."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "A $(l:magic/hexerei#willow_broom)Broom$(/l) will fly once it has a brush. Crows can be won over.$(br2)Swamp witches live in proper houses now. Some live in whole villages."
